Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.86,0:21:39.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\1c&HC2E0EC&\b0}(1915年感恩节）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.45,0:00:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}摩妮卡  这真是史上最棒的  感恩节大餐{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Monica, that was the best Thanksgiving dinner ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.43,0:00:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}太好吃了  你把我们都快撑死了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It was so good. I think you killed us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.83,0:00:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我连一口都吃不下了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I couldn't possibly eat another bite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我要吃甜的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I need something sweet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.13,0:00:23.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}有人想看电视吗  好啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Does anyone wanna watch TV? Yeah. Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.59,0:00:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}摩妮卡  你的遥控器按不动了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Monica, your remote doesn't work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.47,0:00:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}菲比  你得把它拿起来对准{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Phoebe, you have to lift it and point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.96,0:00:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}知道{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.54,0:00:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}算了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.23,0:00:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们知道吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, you know what we should all do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.85,0:00:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们应该来玩感恩告白游戏{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}We should play that game where everyone says one thing they're thankful for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.81,0:00:47.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我要说  感谢今年的秋天这么美{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, I... I am thankful for this beautiful fall we've been having.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.53,0:00:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}说得真好  好甜蜜  乔伊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Very nice. Sweet, Joe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.78,0:00:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那天我在车站等公车{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, the other day, I was at the bus stop...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:54.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}突然吹来一阵可爱的秋风{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and this lovely fall breeze came in out of nowhere...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.84,0:00:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}把一个女生的裙子吹了起来{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and blew this chick's skirt right up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.16,0:01:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对了  我还要感谢丁字裤{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, which reminds me, I'm also thankful for thongs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.100,0:01:06.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}老友记  第五季  第08集  感恩节大回顾{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Friends  S05E08 The One With The Thanksgiving Flashbacks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.25,0:01:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}主演: 寇妮·考克斯{\r}
