Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.89,0:01:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}主演: 麦特·勒布兰{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.56,0:01:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}主演: 马修·派瑞{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.06,0:01:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}主演: 大卫·修蒙{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.09,0:01:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}与其说它是内裤  不如说是一种伟大工程{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's not so much an underpant as it is a feat of engineering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.72,0:02:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}料子那么少  效果却那么大{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's amazing how much they can do with so little material.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.69,0:02:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}它还会戏弄你  有穿吗  没穿吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And the way they play with your mind. I mean, is it there? Is it not there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.73,0:02:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你知道你还在碎碎念吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Are you aware that you're still talking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:14.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}有没有人要感谢  丁字裤以外的东西{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Is anyone thankful for anything else besides a thong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不知道要比较感谢离婚呢  还是感谢被赶出来{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I don't know what to pick. Am I more thankful for my divorce, or my eviction?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.04,0:02:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我还以为  你会没有感谢的呢{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Wow, see, and I didn't think you'd be able to come up with anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.79,0:02:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}抱歉  这是最惨的一次感恩节{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm sorry. It's just this is the worst Thanksgiving ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.48,0:02:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不  不行  我才是悲惨感恩节盟主{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, no, no. I am the king of bad Thanksgivings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.28,0:02:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你不能挟失败的婚姻空降  抢了我的宝座{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You can't just swoop in here with your bad marriage...and take that away from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.93,0:02:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你又要说你爸妈离婚的事了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You're not gonna tell the whole story  about how your parents got divorced, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.56,0:02:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}别这样嘛  我想听{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Come on. I want to hear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.44,0:02:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没有钱德扫兴  就不算感恩节了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It wouldn't be Thanksgiving without Chandler bumming us out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.09,0:02:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这跟游行一样  是一项传统{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's a tradition, like the parade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.22,0:02:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}如果游行也出柜离家  抛妻弃子的话{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}If the parade decided it was gay, moved out and abandoned its entire family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.53,0:03:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}钱德  亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Now, Chandler, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.08,0:03:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}爸爸和我要离婚{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Just because your father and I are getting a divorce...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.41,0:03:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}并不代表我们不爱你{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...doesn't mean we don't love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.75,0:03:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}只是代表他上床的对像是男仆  而不是我{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It just means he would rather sleep with the houseboy than with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.42,0:03:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}小少爷还要火鸡吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}More turkey, Mr. Chandler?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.10,0:03:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你说得对  你的更惨  你是悲惨感恩节盟主{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You're right, yours is worse. You are the king of bad Thanksgivings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:26.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不一定  我有一次更惨{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I don't know about that. I've got one that's worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.69,0:03:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}惨过 "小少爷还要火鸡" 吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Really? Worse than:"More turkey, Mr. Chandler?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.07,0:03:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}小少爷跟仆人有仇吗  对  我的更惨{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Did the little rich boy had a problem with the butler? Yes, mine's worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.49,0:03:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}还要绷带  还要绷带{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}More bandages! More bandages!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}再给我一些绷带  这个人快死…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Please, can I get some more bandages in here? This man is... Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不会吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.93,0:04:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}今生的才算  菲比{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}In this life, Phoebe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.31,0:04:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}今生是吧  那钱德的比较惨{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, this life.Oh, okay. No, Chandler's is worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:10.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}记得前世的事一定很酷吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Man, it must be so cool remembering stuff like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.65,0:04:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我都没有前世的记忆了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I don't have any past life memories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.11,0:04:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}当然没有  你是新生命{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Of course, you don't, sweetie. You're brand-new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.16,0:04:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我知道摩妮卡最惨的感恩节{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I know Monica's worst Thanksgiving.{\r}
